{"lrc":"[00:06.80] What waits for you?\n[00:08.74] What's breaking through?\n[00:11.54] Nothing for good\n[00:14.40] You're sure it's true\n[00:16.36] 永遠なんてないと言い切ってしまったら\n[00:20.28] あまりにも寂しくて 切ないでしょ？\n[00:25.82] 誰もが本当は信じたいけど\n[00:30.54] 裏切られれば深く傷ついてしまうモノ\n[00:35.32] 永遠がある世界が理想ではなく\n[00:37.90] ソレを信じ 続けている姿\n[00:40.38] それこそ僕らが望むべき世界 と気づくことができたなら\n[00:47.00] What will we have?\n[00:52.62] Believe that time is always forever\n[00:56.72] And I'll always be here\n[00:59.50] Believe it till the end\n[01:01.70] I won't go away and won't say never\n[01:06.76] It doesn't have to be friend\n[01:09.28] You can keep it till the end\n[01:11.24] ためしに永遠なんて無いと言い切ろう\n[01:15.84] そしたら希望や夢はいくつ死ぬだろう\n[01:20.36] ソレが存在しない事の絶望と\n[01:23.12] 存在する事の残酷を\n[01:25.44] 想像してみて僕は少しまた\n[01:28.06] めくるページの手を止める\n[01:32.26] How will we have?\n[01:35.95] Believe that time is always forever\n[01:41.86] And I'll always be here\n[01:44.40] Believe it till the end\n[01:46.78] I won't go away and won't say never\n[01:51.60] It doesn't have to be friend\n[01:54.07] You can keep it till the end\n[01:58.17]\n[02:49.94] Believe that time is always forever\n[02:54.36] And I'll always be here\n[02:56.90] Believe it till the end\n[02:59.32] I won't go away and won't say never\n[03:04.08] It doesn't have to be friend\n[03:06.78] You can keep it till the end\n[03:12.14] Can keep it till the end\n[03:15.90] You can keep it till the end (And the time will stay)\n[03:21.96] You can keep it till the end (Time goes by)\n[03:26.11] You can keep it till the end\n[03:29.38]\n","timings":{"lines":[{"t":7.18,"e":9.12,"chars":[{"c":"W","s":7.18,"e":7.3},{"c":"h","s":7.3,"e":7.419},{"c":"a","s":7.419,"e":7.539},{"c":"t","s":7.539,"e":7.659},{"c":" ","s":7.659,"e":7.659},{"c":"w","s":7.659,"e":7.778},{"c":"a","s":7.778,"e":7.898},{"c":"i","s":7.898,"e":8.018},{"c":"t","s":8.018,"e":8.137},{"c":"s","s":8.137,"e":8.257},{"c":" ","s":8.257,"e":8.257},{"c":"f","s":8.257,"e":8.377},{"c":"o","s":8.377,"e":8.496},{"c":"r","s":8.496,"e":8.